#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:180
msgid ""
"%1$s (%2$s) has requested their account be deleted.\n"
"\n"
"Unless they cancel the request, this will happen automatically on %3$s.\n"
"\n"
"%4$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s (%2$s) a demandé la suppression de son compte.\n"
"\n"
"Sauf annulation de sa part, cela se produira automatiquement le %3$s.\n"
"\n"
"%4$s"

#. translators: %s: member's display name.
#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:189
msgid "Account deletion request cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Demande de suppression de compte annulée : %s"

#. translators: 1: display name, 2: email address.
#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:194
msgid ""
"%1$s (%2$s) has cancelled their account deletion request. No action is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"%1$s (%2$s) a annulé sa demande de suppression de compte. Aucune action "
"n'est requise."

#. translators: %s: member's display name.
#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:213
msgid "Account deletion FAILED: %s"
msgstr "Échec de la suppression du compte : %s"

#. translators: 1: display name, 2: email address, 3: user ID.
#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:218
msgid ""
"The scheduled account deletion for %1$s (%2$s, user ID %3$d) did not complete - WordPress refused the delete request.\n"
"\n"
"The account and business listing are still active and the deletion request is still marked as pending. Please investigate (e.g. another plugin blocking user deletion) and delete the account manually if needed."
msgstr ""
"La suppression programmée du compte de %1$s (%2$s, ID utilisateur %3$d) n'a pas abouti : WordPress a refusé la demande de suppression.\n"
"\n"
"Le compte et la fiche d'entreprise sont toujours actifs et la demande de suppression est toujours marquée comme en attente. Veuillez enquêter (par exemple, un autre plugin bloquant la suppression d'utilisateurs) et supprimer le compte manuellement si nécessaire."

#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:228
msgid "Your account has been deleted"
msgstr "Votre compte a été supprimé"

#. translators: %s: member's display name.
#: includes/class-rbn-account-deletion.php:231
msgid ""
"Hi %s,\n"
"\n"
"As requested, your account and business listing have been permanently deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't request this, please contact us straight away."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour %s,\n"
"\n"
"Comme demandé, votre compte et votre fiche d'entreprise ont été définitivement supprimés.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, veuillez nous contacter immédiatement."

